Bundled components
------------------
  * PostgreSQL 16 (PostgreSQL License) — installed from Ubuntu, run inside the container.
  * Language runtimes copied unmodified from the official Windmill CE image: Deno (MIT), Bun (MIT),
    uv (Apache-2.0/MIT), the Go toolchain (BSD-3-Clause).
  * cloudron/base (the platform base image).
